 "text": "Hey! How are you feeling? Totally normal. One way to build confidence is to start on quiet roads where you can stop whenever you want. Start by finding routes that cut through parks rather than busy streets. That way, even if you' stuck in traffic, you still feel safe. Also, always wear a helmet. A few close calls can make you feel a lot better. Lots of people do. And don't worry too much about being in a group. Lots of people ride alone, it makes you more independent.",
